        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-12",
      "text": "猴子说“我只想学道，却又不知，道是什么？”，并拒学参禅打坐、诵经念佛，称“看来，我想学的，你却教不了我”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0114/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0114"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我只想学道，却又不知，道是什么"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-13",
      "text": "猴子说出自己的梦：“我想我飞起时，那天也让开路；我入海时，水也分成两边，众仙诸神，见我也称兄弟，无忧无虑，天下再无可拘我之物，再无可管我之人，再无我到不了之处，再无我做不成之事”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0114/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0114"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我想我飞起时，那天也让开路"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-14",
      "text": "菩提说“我却教不了你”并转身便走，随即化为一根棒槌在猴头上击了三下，棒槌生出双翅飞入一座高墙寺院。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "在猴头上击了三下"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-15",
      "text": "猴子追到寺院门外，因寺门紧闭而跪在门外等候；叙述称他“已跪了六天了”时一片树叶落在他头上，而他本人对白衣人自称“我在这儿跪了七天了”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "已跪了六天了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-16",
      "text": "孙悟空越过寺墙后只见一片白茫茫大地什么也没有，一口气跑出几万里、翻十来个筋斗再落地仍是空旷，遂继续向远方纵去。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "是一边白茫茫的大地，什么也没有"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-17",
      "text": "一名白衣年轻人从山那边行来，步履轻盈如脚不沾泥，笑着站在猴子身后；猴子问他为何身未至却能传声，他答“我身未至，意达即可啊”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我身未至，意达即可"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-18",
      "text": "猴子说他在花果山因从石中生、无父无母、常受人欺，夜深时独自在洞里说话，一棵老树能用心听见；那树本来无心，有只松鼠在它身上出生，它把身子予她住，她便做它的心帮它思想。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0114/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0114"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "它把身子予她住，她便做它的心"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-19",
      "text": "白衣人说这个世界正被“他们”注视着，有时“他们”会借人的口说出想说的话；万物可被随意变幻，要想不被变幻掉，就要先知道自己是什么。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "就要先知道自己是什么"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-20",
      "text": "白衣人说“唵嘛呢叭咪吽就是……七十二变！”，随后将满天水珠聚成一根垂直银柱立于掌心，雨停后大地又穿出绿草、开出千万朵花。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "七十二变"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-21",
      "text": "白衣人说“这个死菩提啊，喜欢玩些这个东西”，指出菩提不肯出来是“因为他在等天下雪”，并反问“你是要求道，还等道来见你么？”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "因为他在等天下雪"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-22",
      "text": "一个不现身的声音对孙悟空说“你走的路不对，累死也枉然”，称“本来没有庙”，并追问他的名字是谁给取的、他从何而生；孙悟空捂住头大叫“我不知道不知道不知道”，那声音呢喃“唉，紧箍咒。观音你够狠”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "紧箍咒。观音你够狠"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-23",
      "text": "叙述称“那是孙悟空的声音大声道：‘我要天下再无我战不胜之物！’”，该声音出现在菩提身后。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我要天下再无我战不胜之物"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-24",
      "text": "菩提以为孙悟空醒来，心中一喜化出身来问“你醒了么”，却见孙悟空仍在地上挣扎、发声者来自他身后；菩提转头看见那只赤足、围草叶、满面稚气的猴子。猴子答“我踢开了门进来的”，菩提心想“不对啊？历史不是这样的”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "历史不是这样的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-25",
      "text": "有人笑道“这猴子真不会说谎。须菩提，别来无恙？”，须菩提一见大叫“金蝉子？”；白衣人回称“须菩提，几千年不见，还是喜欢装腔作势作弄人！”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0113/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0113"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "须菩提，别来无恙？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-26",
      "text": "金蝉子自称与师弟妹在灵山静心苦修，准备灵山第四次结集，将记颂修订三藏经；他觉得自己在世间山水走走、沾沾尘土染染生气更好，所以偷偷溜出来。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "将记颂修订三藏经"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-27",
      "text": "金蝉子从怀中掏出金箍棒，自称“我在路上拣到这个，也不知是谁丢下的”；孙悟空伸手去抢、一把抓住却夺不过来，金蝉子单手轻握金箍棒一头。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我在路上拣到这个"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-28",
      "text": "金蝉子问系草裙的猴子金箍棒是不是他的，那猴子撇嘴说“这东西又不能吃，我要它作甚？”，孙悟空摔倒在地。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0114/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0114"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这东西又不能吃，我要它作甚"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-29",
      "text": "金蝉子提议“不如我们做个朋友，有空一起玩耍”，草裙猴反问他会不会翻筋斗，金蝉子说不会、菩提说自己会；草裙猴要菩提做师父，菩提答“师父是做不得的，我可以教你七十二变，却不准你叫我师父”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0113/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0113"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我可以教你七十二变，却不准你叫我师父"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-30",
      "text": "草裙猴说“好，我就交你们这两个朋友了”；孙悟空被晾在一旁，忽然有种心酸酸的感觉。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0114/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0114"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我就交你们这两个朋友了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-31",
      "text": "金蝉子说结集论法大会就要举行、自己须赶回灵山，并问须菩提是否回去；须菩提答宁愿留在山野对山野唱歌、与花草松鼠说话，佛法经论已忘，去了讲不出来怕师尊生气。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "结集论法大会就要举行了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-32",
      "text": "金蝉子正色说“人只为自己解脱，却不能算得成果”，称一路见众生懵懂、丢不下爱恨痴缠，师尊的法不能解他心中疑惑，此次回灵山不只是诵经还想请师尊解惑；菩提劝其请教可以但不可与师尊争论，并说“师尊是不会有错的。你想不通，定是你自己错了”，金蝉子答“我不争论，怎解我心中疑惑？”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我不争论，怎解我心中疑惑"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-33",
      "text": "金蝉子问“如来是什么？”，菩提答“是如实道来”；金蝉子仰天笑道“鸿蒙初辟原无姓，打破顽冥须悟空”，并称“我为如来，又有何惧？”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0009/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0009"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我为如来，又有何惧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-34",
      "text": "金蝉子将手中的金箍棒抛向孙悟空，孙悟空跳起接住；金蝉子问他可知金箍棒做什么用，说“将来若是有人脑袋不开窍，你就用它敲醒它！”，随后转身大笑而去，尘沙大起却没有一粒沙沾到他身上。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "将手中的金箍棒抛向孙悟空"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-35",
      "text": "草裙猴问“这人是谁？你叫他什么子？”，并说“将来我若有他这种气派，也不枉此生”；菩提答这是个了不起的人物，以二人心气倒适合做师徒，只是他痴迷于大道总说自己未通，并说“他的名字，你不知道也罢，也许这个名字很快就要被人忘记了。若是有缘，将来有一天，你们自会相见”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0113/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0113"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "也许这个名字很快就要被人忘记了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-36",
      "text": "菩提依金蝉子所诵“鸿蒙初辟原无姓，打破顽冥须悟空”，对石中生的猴子说“你像个猢狲，不如便姓孙吧”，为其取名为“孙悟空”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你便叫做孙——悟——空吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-37",
      "text": "那猴子欢喜应道“好！好！自今就叫孙悟空也！”，在天地间蹦跳。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0114/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0114"
      },
      "revealed_at": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000041.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000041",
          "chapter_order": 41,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "自今就叫孙悟空也"
        }
